---
import Layout from '../../../../layouts/Layout.astro'
import DayRating from '../../rateDay/rateDay.astro'

export const post = {
  day: 31,
  title: 'Day 31',
  date: '2026-10-6',
  description: 'I set a new shelf',
  category: 'Daily',
  tags: ['Astro', 'Tailwind CSS', 'Web Development'],
}
---

<Layout>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 pb-24 pt-32">
    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="mb-16">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-sm">
        <span
          class="font-medium uppercase tracking-widest text-[var(--secondary)]"
        >
          {post.category}
        </span>

        <span class="text-[var(--border)]">/</span>

        <span class="text-[var(--muted)]">
          Day {post.day}
        </span>
      </div>

      <h1
        class="mt-6 text-4xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl"
      >
        {post.title}
      </h1>

      <p class="mt-5 text-sm text-[var(--muted)]">
        {
          new Date(post.date).toLocaleDateString('en-GB', {
            day: 'numeric',
            month: 'long',
            year: 'numeric',
          })
        }
      </p>

      <p
        class="mt-8 border-l-2 border-[var(--secondary)] pl-5 text-lg leading-8 text-[var(--muted)] sm:text-xl"
      >
        {post.description}
      </p>
    </header>

    <!-- Content -->
    <div class="space-y-14 leading-8">
      <!-- Section -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="mb-5 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl">
          What I did today?
        </h2>
        <p>
          Today, I only had math lesson, It takes 3h of my day, also my grop was
          removed so I needed to choose my new group I choose 4-th ;;, I also
          meet hung, and I register us for a douubles, I think we can win this
          tournament, I also found a new UI/UX course, I started it, but the
          most important thing is a shelf I finnaly added to my desk, I had
          diffrent plan a bit, but It's still fine
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
    Image of shelf here:
    <img src={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/day31/shelf.png`} />

    <!-- Section -->
    <section class="py-5">
      <h2 class="mb-5 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl">
        Plans for tomorrow
      </h2>

      <p>
        Tomorrow, I have a free day, so I'll try to end UI/UX course I started,
        and, I also have reservation for badminton so I'll go, I also want to
        read part of book
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Section -->
    <section>
      <h2 class="mb-5 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl">
        How I rate this day
      </h2>
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <p>
          I'll give 4/10, I created shelf and it was my main achivment today,
          but I also did some other things
        </p>
        <DayRating class="w-full" rating={4} />
      </div>
    </section>
  </article>
</Layout>
